  [38;5;153mhandlers.js[39m is the package [38;5;153mmain[39m — there is no framework above this to catch it. Fix: make the handler async, [38;5;153mawait[39m
  inside a [38;5;153mtry[39m, map the rejection to a 400 like line 34 already does.

  [1mImportant[0m

