    [38;5;153mTypeError[39m. The base test called it exactly that way (it was rewritten in the same commit, so nothing in-repo is
    broken), but this is a public-API break for external callers. [38;5;153mquery = {}[39m fixes it.
  - [1m[38;5;153mtest/handlers.test.js:26[0m — the pagination test asserts [38;5;153morders.length === 10[39m and never touches the 25 deterministic
    ids it seeded. That is precisely the assertion that would have caught defect 1. The suite passes 2/2 against both
